* Project-local ngspice init for CPLZ-LS01.
*
* ngspice reads ./.spiceinit before ~/.spiceinit, so every deck in this
* directory simulates the same way on any machine.  Committed for the same
* reason as xschem/xschemrc: reproducibility without hardcoded paths.
*
* Kept deliberately minimal -- only what the IHP PSP103.6 corner libraries
* need.  Do not add numeric options (method, reltol, ...) here: the results
* in ../README.md and results/ were produced with ngspice defaults.

* HSPICE-compatible expression/parameter handling, required by cornerMOSlv.lib
* and cornerMOShv.lib.
set ngbehavior=hsa

* Do not reject model cards carrying parameters this ngspice build ignores.
set ng_nomodcheck
